        "2026-09-21"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/conduct/conduct-core/communication-language.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "history",
      "cat-harness:section": "Why this exists",
      "prov:value": "Searched before this skill was written: this repository had a great deal about\nthe language its **content** is in — [`translation-manager`](../../library/library-core/translation-manager.md),\n`defaultLocale`, per-locale `.po` resolution, coverage badges — and **nothing\nat all** about the language an agent SPEAKS IN."
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/conduct/conduct-core/communication-language.md#provenance-3",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "owner-decision",
      "cat-harness:section": "Four inputs, and the order is not negotiable",
      "prov:value": "**Their own turns rank above the model's languages**, and this is the rule an\nimplementation gets backwards. The owner was explicit: *\"the model's languages\nare an INPUT, never the determination\"*. A model strong in a language the\nperson cannot read is **worse** than the fallback, not better. Rank 3 exists\nto say *\"this pairing may be better served by something other than the\ncorpus's language\"* — it never selects one on its own.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "owner"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
